    "source": "Joan of Arc, trial at Rouen, 1431, in T. Douglas Murray, trans., Jeanne d’Arc, Maid of Orleans (1902), p. 74. https://archive.org/details/jeannedarcmaidof00murruoft"
   },
   {
    "text": "In God’s name, the counsel of God our Lord is surer and wiser than yours.",
    "topics": [
     "wisdom",
     "faith"
    ],
    "source": "Joan of Arc to Dunois at Orléans, April 1429, in Dunois’s deposition of 1456, Quicherat, Procès, vol. 3, pp. 5–6 (our translation). https://archive.org/details/procsdecondam03joanuoft"
   },
   {
    "text": "I bring you better help than ever came to any soldier or any city, for it is help from the King of Heaven.",
    "topics": [
