    ],
    "source": "Joan of Arc, August 1429, in Dunois’s deposition of 1456, Quicherat, Procès, vol. 3, pp. 14–15 (our translation). https://archive.org/details/procsdecondam03joanuoft"
   },
   {
    "text": "I have sworn and given my faith to another than you, and I will keep my oath to him.",
